---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../../../site.config';
---
<Base title={`Privacy | ${site.name}`} description={`What ${site.name} collects: no cookies, no analytics, and form submissions sent by email only.`} path="/privacy/" crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }]}>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lead">{site.name} sets no cookies and runs no analytics or advertising scripts.</p>
  <h2>The add or update form</h2>
  <p>When you send the form, your answers are emailed to us and not stored on this website. We use your name and email only to reply about that listing. Your contact details are never published; only the business details you send may appear on a listing.</p>
  <p>The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to block spam, which may process your IP address and browser details under Cloudflare’s privacy policy.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes standard request logs to deliver pages and stop abuse.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>To have a submission deleted, use <a href="/add-your-business/">the form</a> and say so in the description.</p>
</Base>
